<title>USA: Solucorp gets 2nd work order from US Steel.</title>
<headline>Solucorp gets 2nd work order from US Steel.</headline>
<dateline>WEST NYACK, N.Y. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solucorp Industries Ltd said Wednesday it successfully completed a work order cleaning up heavy metals contamination at a USX-US Steel Group site in Minnesota.</p>
<p>Based on the results, the company said US Steel has issued a second work order to continue to remediate additional tonnage at the site.</p>
<p>Terms of the contracts were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
